<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ dollar market closed Wednesday, Thursday.</title>
<headline>NZ dollar market closed Wednesday, Thursday.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-01-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New Zealand foreign exchange market was closed on Wednesday and Thursday for New Year holidays.</p>
<p>It will reopen on Friday for a full day's trading.</p>
<p>The kiwi closed at US$0.7075/82 and at 67.63 on the Trade Weighted Index on Tuesday.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 473 4746</p>
</text>
